  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 401.03 Notice of Invalidation. On or after August 1st of each year, the board shall send a notice, by first class mail, to the last known address of any previously licensed water well contractor or pump installer whose license expired on June 30th of that year, informing the previous licensee that:\n\n(a) The license expired on June 30th;\n\n(b) The late fee of $20 required by RSA 482-B:5, I, shall be filed in addition to the regular license fee; and\n\n(c) If a renewal application, together with the required fees, is not received within one year from the expiration date, the licensee shall be required to reapply and meet all of the requirements of a new applicant, including examination.\n\nSource. #2557, eff 12-27-83; ss by #4730, eff 1-15-90; ss by #4898, eff 8-13-90; EXPIRED: 8-13-96\n\nNew. #6327, INTERIM, eff 8-24-96, EXPIRED: 12-22-96\n\nNew. #6449, eff 1-29-97; ss by #7307, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9179, eff 6-13-08; ss by #12083, eff 3-1-17 (See Revision Notes at Chapter headings for We 300 and We 600)",
